OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a 
OL,6,Fdry evening and night with mostly      
OL,7,Fclear skies. Frost will become         
OL,8,Fwidespread on the mainland, severe in  
OL,9,Fplaces, while the Isles will be milder 
OL,10,Fthrough windy.                         
OL,12,CMonday:FAnother dry day with some long 
OL,13,Fsunny spells for most though the Isles 
OL,14,Fwill turn cloudier later. The Isles    
OL,15,Falso windy, but lighter winds and      
OL,16,Ffrost early and late inland.           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
