OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain  
OL,6,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on 
OL,7,Fhigher ground for a time. Patchy rain  
OL,8,Fon Wednesday then mainly dry on        
OL,9,FThursday.                              
